    "HS-CAN = 500 kbit/s (std, 11-bit ID); MS-CAN = 125 kbit/s",
    "Rules: 5 seconds silence -> action 5-10 seconds -> 5 seconds after; each test x3; pause >=10 seconds; ABS/DSC — closed lot only"
