   "id": "11",
   "title": "Mapping table (for the gateway)",
   "warn": "Table format: Parameter | Source (RX-8) | Receiver (ND) | Gateway action.",
   "checklist": [
    "RPM: RX-8 0x201 bytes 0-1 UINT16×0.25 → ND 0x202 bytes 0-1 UINT16/4 — receive → recalculate → send",
    "Vehicle speed: 0x201 bytes 4-5 UINT16/100 → 0x202 bytes 2-3 INT16/360",
    "Accelerator: 0x201 byte 6 UINT8/2 → 0x202 byte 6 UINT8/2.5",
    "Brake: 0x212 byte 5 mask 0x08 → 0x78 (complex formula) — pass the bit state through",
    "Handbrake: 0x212 byte 4 mask 0x40 → confirm the ID",
    "Neutral: 0x231 byte 0 mask 0x80 → 0x165 (position)",
    "Coolant temperature: 0x420 byte 0 −40 → confirm",
    "Steering angle: confirm the ID → 0x86 (16000−UINT16)×0.1",
    "Immobilizer: none → expects the PCM SYNC code — EMULATE",
    "EPS: RX-8 ECU sends signal → ND expects PCM signal — emulate or disable",
    "ABS/DSC: RX-8 does not control ND DSC → expects torque signal — EMULATE"
   ],
   "tests": []
